# Question 4

### Divide employees in each department into 2 salary groups and display only Group 1 employees.

Since we cannot directly use the window-function alias in the same `WHERE` level, use a subquery.

### Answer

```sql
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT *,
           NTILE(2) OVER(
               PARTITION BY Department
               ORDER BY Salary DESC
           ) AS salary_group
    FROM Employees
) AS D1
WHERE D1.salary_group = 1;
```

### Result

| Name  | Department | Salary | salary_group |
| ----- | ---------- | -----: | -----------: |
| Mike  | IT         |  70000 |            1 |
| Sam   | IT         |  60000 |            1 |
| Bob   | HR         |  45000 |            1 |
| Emma  | Sales      |  80000 |            1 |
| David | Sales      |  70000 |            1 |

---

